{'symbol': 'MMM', 'date': '2023-05-31 10:05:00', 'title': '3M TO INVEST NEARLY $150 MILLION TO ADVANCE CAPABILITIES IN BIOPHARMA FILTRATION TECHNOLOGY', 'text': 'ST. PAUL, MINN. , MAY 31, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- APPLYING ITS LEADERSHIP IN BIOPHARMA FILTRATION TECHNOLOGY, 3M (NYSE: MMM) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL INVEST $146 MILLION DOLLARS TO EXPAND ITS CAPABILITIES TO FURTHER SUPPORT BIOTECH MANUFACTURING, A FAST-GROWING AREA OF HEALTH CARE WHICH IS BRINGING BREAKTHROUGH THERAPIES TO PATIENTS.'}